Package: smoothbp
Title: Hierarchical Piecewise Regression with Smoothed Change-Points
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("smoothbp", "Authors", , "author@example.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Fits Bayesian hierarchical piecewise regression models with a
    logistic-smoothed change-point. Non-linear parameters (change-point location
    and transition sharpness) and linear parameters can each be conditioned on
    covariates and factors via flexible design matrices. A random-intercept
    structure is supported for any parameter. Posterior inference uses a
    Metropolis-within-Gibbs sampler implemented in Rust for speed.
